        "content": "<div style=\"display:flex; gap:6px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; padding:2px 0; margin: -4px 0;\">\n  <a href=\"/d/landing-page?from=${__from}&to=${__to}\" style=\"padding:4px 12px; background:#1e1e2e; color:#8ab4f8; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; font-size:13px; font-weight:600; border:1px solid #333;\">Home</a>\n  <span style=\"color:#444; font-size:16px;\">|</span>\n  <a href=\"/d/fleet-view?from=${__from}&to=${__to}\" style=\"padding:4px 10px; background:#1e1e2e; color:#b0b0c0; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; font-size:12px; border:1px solid #2a2a3a;\">Fleet</a>\n  <a href=\"/d/fd-ai-spend-overview-v2?var-agg=$__auto&from=${__from}&to=${__to}\" style=\"padding:4px 10px; background:#1e1e2e; color:#b0b0c0; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; font-size:12px; border:1px solid #2a2a3a;\">Spend</a>\n  <a href=\"/d/fd-cost-explorer-v2?var-agg=$__auto&from=${__from}&to=${__to}\" style=\"padding:4px 10px; background:#1e1e2e; color:#b0b0c0; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; font-size:12px; border:1px solid #2a2a3a;\">Trace</a>\n  <a href=\"/d/fd-usage-effectiveness-v2?var-agg=$__auto&from=${__from}&to=${__to}\" style=\"padding:4px 10px; background:#1e1e2e; color:#b0b0c0; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; font-size:12px; border:1px solid #2a2a3a;\">Usage</a>\n  <span style=\"color:#444; font-size:16px;\">|</span>\n  <a href=\"/d/cost-by-tag-value?var-agg=$__auto&from=${__from}&to=${__to}\" style=\"padding:4px 10px; background:#1e1e2e; color:#b0b0c0; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; font-size:12px; border:1px solid #2a2a3a;\">Simple Cost</a>\n  <a href=\"/d/tag-stack-explorer?var-agg=$__auto&from=${__from}&to=${__to}\" style=\"padding:4px 10px; background:#1e1e2e; color:#b0b0c0; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; font-size:12px; border:1px solid #2a2a3a;\">Multidim</a>\n  <a href=\"/d/entity-cost-explorer?var-agg=$__auto&from=${__from}&to=${__to}\" style=\"padding:4px 10px; background:#1e1e2e; color:#b0b0c0; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; font-size:12px; border:1px solid #2a2a3a;\">Work</a>\n  <a href=\"/d/fd-outcome-accounting-v2?var-agg=$__auto&from=${__from}&to=${__to}\" style=\"padding:4px 10px; background:#1e1e2e; color:#b0b0c0; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; font-size:12px; border:1px solid #2a2a3a;\">Outcomes</a>\n  <a href=\"/d/outcome-cost-explorer?var-agg=$__auto&from=${__from}&to=${__to}\" style=\"padding:4px 10px; background:#2a2a4a; color:#8ab4f8; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; border:1px solid #4a4a6a;\">Outcome Cost</a>\n  <span style=\"color:#444; font-size:16px;\">|</span>\n  <a href=\"/d/fd-data-quality-v2?var-agg=$__auto&from=${__from}&to=${__to}\" style=\"padding:4px 10px; background:#1e1e2e; color:#b0b0c0; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; font-size:12px; border:1px solid #2a2a3a;\">Health</a>\n</div>",
